Tools Requirements
At the time of this post, many popular tools has JDK 14 support only in their
Preview / Beta releases. 

 * Java 14 SDK
 * Gradle 6.3 (currently in RC. Any version lower than 6.3 will not work because
   of Issue #10248 [https://github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/10248] )
 * Intellij 2020.1 (currently in EAP
   [https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/nextversion/])
 * Compile and run java with correct flags for preview features. 

Using SDKMan [https://sdkman.io] helps installing Java/Gradle with ease.

$ sdk install java 14.0.0.hs-adpt
$ sdk install gradle 6.3-rc-4

After importing the project in IntelliJ, make sure JDK 14 is being used for both
Project SDK and Gradle. Language level should be 14 (Preview) for all the
preview features to be highlighted correctly.
